      "blurb": "Contracted drell elimination specialist",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Drell assassins are among the most feared in the Shadow Broker's network and across Terminus mercenary operations. Their eidetic memory ensures they know exactly what their target looks like, where they go, and what their patterns are. Their natural toxin and close-quarters training make them lethal at every range.</p><p><strong>Perfect Recall:</strong> +2 to all Recall Knowledge checks. Automatically recalls observed events.</p><p><strong>Sneak Attack:</strong> Deals 2d6 extra precision damage to flat-footed targets.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 40 Shield HP. Recharges 10 HP per turn.</p>",
